# Repo-wide: every text file is stored and checked out as LF, on every
# platform. Windows text handling has shipped two real incidents here (a BOM
# killing the first CSS rule; CRLF nearly breaking the vendored-types drift
# comparison) — one policy ends the class.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary

# The vendored type definitions under types/ are compared byte-wise against
# the copies npm installs, and npm tarballs ship LF. Covered by the rule
# above; kept explicit because the comparison breaking would look like type
# drift when it isn't.
types/**/*.d.ts text eol=lf
